{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51198","headline":"五言白话诗 五 · 缺名","name":"五言白话诗 五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"家中渐渐贫，良由慵懒妇。\n长头爱床坐，饱吃没娑肚。\n频年懃生儿，不肯收家具。\n饮酒五夫敌，不解缝衫袴。\n（「不解」，斯五六四一卷作「不能」。\n）事当好衣裳，得便走出去。\n不要男爲伴，心里恒攀慕。\n东家能湼舌，西家好合[鬭]。\n两家既不和，角眼相蛆姡。\n别觅好时对，趁却莫交住。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"缺名","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51198.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51198","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}